{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31841","headline":"题刘华书斋 · 贾岛","name":"题刘华书斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白石床无尘，青松树有鳞。\n一莺啼带雨，两树合从春。\n荒榭苔胶砌，幽丛果堕榛。\n偶来疎或数，当暑夕胜晨。\n露滴星河水，巢重草木薪。\n终南同往意，赵北独游身。\n渡叶司天漏，惊蛩远地人。\n机清公干族，也莫卧漳滨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}